# =============================================================================

# Standalone compute API server (monetization layer — hosted only)
src/api/
.vercel

# Rotated/archived runtime logs (cost-opt: bounded logs)
*.log.gz
run.log.*
ui/webapp/src-tauri/Cargo.lock

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operator-local state — kept on disk, never versioned
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent/tooling session state (plans, continue files). Machine-generated, and it
# accumulates local process ids and absolute paths as work proceeds.
.zcode/

# Internal handoff note. It is the operator's own entry point, so it stays on
# disk and is deliberately NOT versioned: it carries local process ids, the
# operator's machine-specific paths, and a running account of unfinished work.
# Everything a contributor needs belongs in README.md / docs/, which ARE tracked.
HANDOFF.md
